_-New metrics added: unique trip IDs, average speeds, complaint volumes, fines, and trip warnings._

_-Operators must provide demo of reporting platform before launch_

*Insurance:* In V1 the Public liability insurance minimum = *£2 million*. *V2*: Raised to{color:#ff5630} {color}{color:#ff5630}+*£5 million*+ {color}(I will leave [~accountid:62a3287576c0360069f59b72] / [~accountid:61f116071c42100069544016] to comment on the insurance aspects). 

